  "content": {
    "title": "吉林省公开招聘2013届免费师范毕业生专场招聘会在吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心举行",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2012-12-02",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">吉林省公开招聘2013届免费师范毕业生专场招聘会在吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心举行</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:信息部   发布时间:2012-12-2 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://90ccc2aa446d9d506fd967bbec7f89be3234bd14a03f9d60c0254c0c0c4d24e7\"></p> <p align=\"center\">12月1-2日，吉林省公开招聘2013届免费师范毕业生专场招聘会在吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心举行。</p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://66969cadc05f000c8321f1f02805220189922e1c2c8ec2b31eb1883b1411ff45\"></p> <p align=\"center\">省教育厅高校学生处纪拓处长到会指导工作。</p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://8d8b567490feb248900a4b7a8b921e2eb127984a0ea899d0516bf22e7674d929\"></p> <p align=\"center\">招聘会现场</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
